was corrupting her brothers, returning the favor with toys, little trips, and money.
She sighed. What a wonderful teacher he was, her husband. She saw little of him, because she avoided him, but also because he was away from the house most of the time, returning only for the main meals. One day he was in London, and they didn’t see each other at all.
